[ceiling] Required rigid-collar insertion mouth: the fore column's 18.6 mm straight west opening admits the meter's nominal 18.3 mm fixed collar. Its lower cheek completes the column's 3 mm base stock. The native Mark2 slice places automatic tree support in the open mouth, removed before fitting the meter. Physical release and the purchased fit remain unqualified.
alternatives: A gable raised into the mouth reduces its full collar-admission envelope. Removing the lower west cheek adds a lower step to the shared column outline. Retaining the rectangular mouth preserves the insertion profile and the simple full-stock column.
file: hardware/printed-parts/enclosure/enclosure/enclosure-back-top.step
