[step] Fitted PSU bearing and running-well planes: the four screw ears bear at Z348.50 while the surrounding case well ends at Z348.75, retaining 0.25 mm running clearance over the purchased case. These are separate mating planes with a specified difference.
alternatives: Lowering the well roof onto the ears occupies the case clearance. Raising the bearings changes the PSU mounting plane and the blind-pilot stack.
