[step] Fitted ground-ring landing beside the retained core hold: the ground face is Y461.70, 0.60 mm fore of the core/rear-wall land at Y462.30. The M3x8 stack has 4.8 mm screw projection, 0.5 mm tip air and 3.1 mm backing to the fluted exterior at this landing.
alternatives: Moving the ground landing aft onto the core land reduces its fluted backing to 2.5 mm. Extending the adjacent land fore changes the retained core hold and dry-connector boundary.
