[sliver] Rear Wago half-well boundary at the enclosure’s retained rounded corner: the 1.017 mm dimension is the Y extent of the exposed outer side face where the rectangular half-well meets that corner. Its actual side-wall section is 3 mm in X, from X−97.55 to the pocket plane X−94.55. The well must retain the purchased rectangular blank half while leaving its lever and wire-entry half open.
alternatives: Changing this boundary to a 3 mm Y strip requires moving the complete fitted well away from the retained rear corner or changing that corner. Thickening the X wall does not change the classified face extent; filling the open half occupies the lever and wire-entry access.
