[thin] Fitted PSU blind-pilot floors: the selected M3x10 screws accommodate the vendor drawing’s 6.7±1 mm mounting-ear thickness. Their maximum projection is 4.3 mm; the 5.3 mm pilot keeps 1 mm tip air. The bearing at Z348.5 and exterior roof at Z355 leave a 1.2 mm blind end at each pilot. This is a bounded fastener clearance exception, not ordinary ceiling stock.
alternatives: A 3 mm blind end requires lowering the PSU by 1.8 mm, putting its Z313.2 underside into the pump envelope ending at Z313.935. M3x8 leaves only 0.3 mm projection at the thick-ear limit. Raising the exterior roof changes the enclosure height and funnel plane.
