alternatives: Growing the wall to 3 mm moves its end to Y446.56, 0.05 mm into the neighboring occupied envelope. Moving the meter fore instead changes its direct SODA stub, both snap interfaces and the R14 inlet/foam holder. Narrowing its fitted pocket spends the housing and axial-position allowance.
